<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">The City of Columbus of Columbus has a long-standing tradition of employees giving back to our community through departmental initiatives, Employee Resource Groups, and individual volunteer efforts.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>To build on that strong foundation, the City is excited to partner with Besa to strengthen and better connect our volunteer and community engagement efforts. </strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><a href="https://impact.besa.org/events/15869?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">With your support and participation</a>, we have an opportunity to expand upon the incredible work already taking place while creating a more coordinated approach to volunteerism citywide.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">As we kickoff this partnership, Besa Founder &amp; CEO Matthew Goldstein shared this welcome and invitation to our upcoming partnership kickoff on October 8 at 77 N. Front:</p>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%"><hr></td></tr></table>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">This partnership has a special place in my heart because, over the past several years, Besa and the City have worked side by side during some of our community’s most important moments—from helping distribute more than 500,000 face masks during the height of the pandemic to mobilizing volunteers in response to last month’s storms. Those efforts reminded me what’s possible when we work together. </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>I’d love to personally invite you to our Besa x City of Columbus Kickoff on Thursday, October 8 at 77 N Front Street.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong><u>Partnership Kickoff:</u></strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Thursday, October 8</strong><br><strong>10 A.M. – 11 A.M.</strong><br><strong>Lower Atrium</strong><br><strong>77 North Front Street</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">*Employee Parking Available*</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We’ll share more about the partnership, enjoy great food, music, and a few surprises along the way. And because service is at the center of everything we do, we’ll also roll up our sleeves together to assemble snack bags and other essential items for hundreds of families across our community.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Whether this is your first time volunteering or your hundredth, I hope you’ll join us as we launch something meaningful together.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Sign Up Here: <a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/impact.besa.org/events/15869__;!!Ibw6q7MDdYV6!R2q76tT55s8nD7GwSJoxKyusHJTnaEkAtNAPOhbzBBCGvMoL2xAmhE5aAtRtKMwtIJxAbE_l-mE3nZZ9ts7paxpv%24?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://impact.besa.org/events/15869</a></strong></p>
